      "officialTitle": "A Prospective, Multicenter, Randomized, Masked, Controlled Study to Evaluate the Safety and Efficacy of the Bimatoprost Implant System (78 mcg) Used in Combination With the SpyGlass IOL Compared to Timolol Maleate Ophthalmic Solution, USP, 0.5%,",
